<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>🚨 Action requise : Paiement en retard - Aiolia Event</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f6f8;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            color: #232c33; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 15px;
        }
        .email-wrapper { width: 100%; padding: 40px 12px; }
        .email-card { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); }
        .email-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc3545 0%, #c82333 100%);
            padding: 40px 32px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff;
        }
        .email-header h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; }
        .email-body { padding: 40px 36px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 16px; color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .alert-danger {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8d7da 0%, #f5c6cb 100%);
            border: 2px solid #dc3545; border-left: 6px solid #dc3545;
            padding: 20px 24px; margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .alert-danger strong { color: #721c24; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 18px; }
        .alert-danger p { color: #721c24; margin: 8px 0; }
        .invoice-details {
            background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 28px; margin: 28px 0;
        }
        .invoice-details h2 { margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F2D3D; border-bottom: 2px solid #dc3545; padding-bottom: 12px; }
        .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
        .info-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .info-label { color: #5c6b73; font-weight: 500; }
        .info-value { color: #2c3e50; font-weight: 600; }
        .days-overdue {
            display: inline-block; background: #dc3545; color: white;
            padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-left: 8px;
        }
        .cta { text-align: center; margin: 36px 0 24px; }
        .cta a {
            display: inline-block; padding: 16px 48px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc3545 0%, #c82333 100%);
            color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px; border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.3);
        }
        .footer { padding: 32px 36px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6c757d; background: #f8f9fa; border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6; }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-body { padding: 28px 24px; }
            .invoice-details { padding: 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-card">
            <div class="email-header">
                <h1>🚨 Action requise : Paiement en retard</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="email-body">
                <p class="greeting">Bonjour {{ customer.prenom ?? customer.nom ?? 'Cher client' }},</p>
                
                <div class="alert-danger">
                    <strong>DERNIER RAPPEL AVANT SUSPENSION</strong>
                    <p>Votre facture d'abonnement est en retard de {{ daysOverdue }} jour(s).</p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Si le paiement n'est pas effectué dans les 3 prochains jours, votre compte sera automatiquement suspendu.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="invoice-details">
                    <h2>Détails de la facture</h2>
                    <div class="info-row">
                        <span class="info-label">Numéro de facture :</span>
                        <span class="info-value">{{ invoice.invoiceNumber }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-row">
                        <span class="info-label">Date d'échéance :</span>
                        <span class="info-value">{{ invoice.dueAt ? invoice.dueAt|date('d/m/Y') : 'N/A' }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-row">
                        <span class="info-label">Jours de retard :</span>
                        <span class="info-value">{{ daysOverdue }} jour(s)<span class="days-overdue">URGENT</span></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-row">
                        <span class="info-label">Montant dû :</span>
                        <span class="info-value" style="font-size: 20px; color: #dc3545; font-weight: 700;">{{ invoice.totalAmount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currency }}</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: #495057; font-weight: 600;">Pour éviter la suspension de votre compte, veuillez régulariser votre paiement immédiatement.</p>
                
                <div class="cta">
                    <a href="#">Payer immédiatement</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p><strong>Aiolia Event</strong></p>
                <p>Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement. Merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

